#: ../../library/templates/specTemplates.rst:25
msgid "Complete the following fields, then click :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`:"
msgstr "Complete los siguientes campos:"

#: ../../library/templates/specTemplates.rst:27
msgid "**NAME**"
msgstr "**NAME**"

#: ../../library/templates/specTemplates.rst:28
msgid ""
"**TYPE:** See the previous section for a complete list of Spec Template "
"types"
msgstr "**TYPE:** See el/la anterior section para un/una complete list de Plantilla de especificación types"

#: ../../library/templates/specTemplates.rst:29
msgid "**SOURCE:** Local, Repository, or URL"
msgstr "**SOURCE:** Local, Repository, or URL"

#: ../../library/templates/specTemplates.rst:30
msgid ""
"**CONTENT:** If this is a local Spec Template, supply the template in "
"this field. If the template is supplied through a URL or online "
"repository, the CONTENT field will change to allow the user to point "
"|morpheus| to that resource"
msgstr "**CONTENT:** Si este/esta es un/una local Plantilla de especificación, supply el/la template en este/esta field. Si el/la template es supplied a través de un/una URL o online repository, el/la CONTENT field será/n change a allow el/la user a point |morpheus| a ese/esa resource"

#: ../../library/templates/specTemplates.rst:31
msgid ""
"**VERSION:** (Only displayed on Terraform Spec Templates) Enter a "
"Terraform version number to force a specific version when provisioning "
"your Terraform Instance Type or App, assuming your Terraform Runtime "
"setting (|AdmSetPro| Tab) is \"auto\". If Terraform Runtime is set to "
"\"manual\", |morpheus| will use the version of Terraform installed on the"
" appliance box"
msgstr "**VERSION:** (Only displayed en Terraform Plantillas de especificación) Enter un/una Terraform version number a force un/una específico/específica version cuando provisioning your Terraform Tipo de instancia o App, assuming your Terraform Runtime setting (|AdmSetPro| Tab) es \"auto\". Si Terraform Runtime es establecido/establecida a \"manual\", |morpheus| será/n use el/la version de Terraform installed en el/la appliance box"

#: ../../library/templates/file_templates.rst:2
msgid "File Templates"
msgstr "Plantillas de archivo"

#: ../../library/templates/file_templates.rst:4
msgid ""
"File Templates are for generating config files, such as my.cnf, "
"elasticsearch.yml, morpheus.rb, or any text file. With full config map "
"variable support, Template Files are dynamically generated during a "
"Workflow phase or ad hoc via Instance actions."
msgstr "Plantillas de archivo son para generating config files, such como my.cnf, elasticsearch.yml, morpheus.rb, o cualquier text file. With full config map variable support, Template Files son dynamically generated durante un/una Flujo de trabajo phase o ad hoc via Instancia actions."

#: ../../library/templates/file_templates.rst:6
msgid ""
"File Templates can also be exposed on Instances in the Settings Tab. "
"Ensure the Instance Type supports settings, and Category is defined in "
"Advance Options on the Library Template config."
msgstr "Plantillas de archivo puede/n también be exposed en Instancias en el/la Settings Tab. Ensure el/la Tipo de instancia supports settings, y Category es definido/definida en Advance Options en el/la Library Template config."

#: ../../library/templates/file_templates.rst:8
msgid ""
"|morpheus| variables are supported in Library Templates using ``<%= "
"variable.var %>`` format"
msgstr "|morpheus| variables are supported in Library Templates using ``<%= variable.var %>`` format"

