msgid "PHASE"
msgstr "FASE"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:19
msgid ""
"Select which phase the Script will execute when attached to a Node Type. "
"When a script is attached to a Node Type, it will execute according to "
"the selcted phase:"
msgstr "Select which phase the Script will execute when attached to a Tipo de nodo. When a script is attached to a Tipo de nodo, it ejecutará according to the selcted phase:"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:21
msgid "Start Service"
msgstr "Start Service"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:22
msgid "Any time the Instance action ``Start Service`` is executed"
msgstr "Cualquier time el/la Instancia action ``Start Service`` es executed"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:23
msgid "Stop Service"
msgstr "Stop Service"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:24
msgid "Any time the Instance action ``Stop Service`` is executed"
msgstr "Cualquier time el/la Instancia action ``Stop Service`` es executed"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:26
msgid "Pre-Provision"
msgstr "Pre-Provision"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:26
msgid ""
"Containers: Script will execute against the container host before the "
"container is provisioned"
msgstr "Contenedores: Script ejecutará against the container host before the container is provisioned"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:27
msgid ""
"Virtual Machines: Script will execute before any provision phase Scripts "
"or Tasks"
msgstr "Virtual Machines: Script will execute before any provision phase Scripts or Tareas"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:42
msgid "Provision"
msgstr "Aprovisionar"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:29
msgid ""
"Script will execute once per new Instance node during the provision "
"Phase. Provisioning will not be considered complete until all scripts and"
" tasks in the provisioning phase are completed"
msgstr "Script ejecutará once per new Instancia node during the provision Phase. Provisioning will not be considered complete until all scripts and tasks in the provisioning phase are completed"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:31
msgid ""
"Any Script or Task set to the provision phase will be included in the "
"total provision time and impact success/warn/failure provisioning status "
"messages. As an example, your VM could be up and running but if your "
"Script is in the provision phase and fails, provisioning will be marked "
"as a failure."
msgstr "Cualquier Script o Tarea establecido/establecida a el/la provision phase será/n be included en el/la total provision time y impact success/warn/failure provisioning status messages. As un/una example, your VM could be arriba y running but si your Script es en el/la provision phase y fails, provisioning será/n be marked como un/una failure."

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:33
msgid "Post-Provision"
msgstr "Post-Provision"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:34
msgid ""
"Script will execute once per new Instance node after the provision phase "
"is completed. Scripts and Tasks in the Post-Provision phase will show "
"execution status and history, but are not considered part of the "
"provision and do not impact provisioning status."
msgstr "Script ejecutará once per new Instancia node after the provision phase is completed. Scripts and Tareas in the Post-Provision phase will show execution status and history, but are not considered part of the provision and do not impact provisioning status."

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:35
msgid "Pre-Deploy"
msgstr "Pre-Deploy"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:36
msgid ""
"Script will execute on target Instance any time a deployment is run "
"against the Instance. The Script will run prior to the deployment file(s)"
" being written"
msgstr "Script ejecutará on target Instancia any time a deployment is run against the Instancia. The Script will run prior to the deployment file(s) being written"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:37
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "Deploy"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:38
msgid ""
"Script will execute on target Instance any time a deployment is run "
"against the Instance. The script will run after the deployment file(s) "
"are written"
msgstr "Script ejecutará on target Instancia any time a deployment is run against the Instancia. The script will run after the deployment file(s) are written"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:39
msgid "Reconfigure"
msgstr "Reconfigurar"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:40
msgid ""
"Script will execute on target Instance any time a reconfigure is executed"
" against the Instance."
msgstr "Script ejecutará on target Instancia any time a reconfigure is executed against the Instancia."

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:42
msgid "Teardown"
msgstr "Desmontar"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:42
msgid ""
"Script will execute on target Instance upon Instance deletion. Script "
"will execute against target Instance prior to the deletion/removal of "
"resources."
msgstr "Script will execute on target Instancia upon Instancia deletion. Script ejecutará against target Instancia prior to the deletion/removal of resources."

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:47
msgid "SCRIPT"
msgstr "SCRIPT"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:45
msgid "Enter Bash or Powershell script."
msgstr "Enter Bash or Powershell script."

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:47
msgid ""
"|morpheus| variables are supported in Library Scripts using ``<%= "
"variable.var %>`` format"
msgstr "|morpheus| variables are supported in Library Scripts using ``<%= variable.var %>`` format"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:49
msgid "RUN AS USER"
msgstr "RUN AS USER"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:50
msgid ""
"By default Scripts are execute as ``morpheus-node``. To execute as "
"another User, populate ``RUN AS USER`` and ensure proper user permissions"
" & group access"
msgstr "By default Scripts are execute as ``morpheus-node``. To execute as another User, populate ``RUN AS USER`` and ensure proper user permissions & group access"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:53
msgid "SUDO"
msgstr "SUDO"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:52
msgid "Flag ``SUDO`` if sudo is required to execute the Script"
msgstr "Flag ``SUDO`` si sudo es requerido/requerida a execute el/la Script"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:55
msgid ""
"To attach Scripts and templates that have been added to the Library to a "
"Node Type, start typing the name and then select the script(s) and/or "
"template(s)."
msgstr "To attach Scripts y templates ese/esa tienen been agregado/agregada a el/la Library a un/una Tipo de nodo, start typing el/la name y entonces select el/la script(s) and/or template(s)."

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:57
msgid "Multiple scripts and templates can be added to a Node Type"
msgstr "Multiple scripts and templates se puede agregar to a Tipo de nodo"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:58
msgid "Scripts and Templates can be added/shared among multiple Node Types"
msgstr "Scripts and Templates se puede agregar/shared among multiple Tipos de nodo"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:59
msgid "The execution phase can be set for Scripts in the Scripts section"
msgstr "The execution phase puede ser set for Scripts in the Scripts section"

#: ../../library/templates/scripts.rst:60
msgid ""
"Search will populate Scripts or Templates containing the characters "
"entered anywhere in their name, not just the first letter(s) of the name"
msgstr "Search será/n populate Scripts o Templates containing el/la characters entered anywhere en their name, ningún just el/la primer/primera letter(s) de el/la name"

